1
00:00:12,120 --> 00:00:13,460
菲尔 亲爱的
Phil, honey!

2
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:14,880
菲尔
Phil!

3
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:16,800
快来看
Hey, check it out.

4
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:17,620
爷爷开房车自驾游
Grandpa sent us another

5
00:00:17,620 --> 00:00:18,980
又给我们寄了一张明信片
postcard from his RV trip.

6
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:20,220
拉什莫尔山
"Mount Rushmore?

7
00:00:20,440 --> 00:00:22,920
要是导游拉我们走快点就好了
I wish the tour guide would have rushed more."

8
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:24,420
菲尔 我们得对安布尔和罗尼的船
Phil, we have got to do something

9
00:00:24,420 --> 00:00:25,460
采取点措施了
about Amber and Ronnie's boat.

10
00:00:25,520 --> 00:00:26,940
那玩意儿害我们没法儿
That thing is making it impossible

11
00:00:26,940 --> 00:00:29,400
在我们的车道上停车 而且还那么丑
to park in our driveway, and it's an eyesore.

12
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:30,559
但他们是我们的邻居
On the other hand, they're our neighbors

13
00:00:30,559 --> 00:00:31,780
抬头不见低头见
and we have to see them everyday.

14
00:00:31,840 --> 00:00:33,840
我担心那会...破坏船[破坏现状]
I worry about...rocking the boat.

15
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:35,180
这可不是你的真实水平啊
You know you can do better.

16
00:00:35,260 --> 00:00:36,800
让我保持清醒认识 我喜欢
Keeping me honest. I love it.

17
00:00:37,118 --> 00:00:38,900
是啊 那船太破了
Yeah, the boat is trashy.

18
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:41,340
住在旁边可不会让我觉得有面子
Living next to it doesn't feel "on brand" for me.

19
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:43,620
以现在海平面上升的速度
You know, with sea levels rising at their current rate,

20
00:00:43,660 --> 00:00:45,260
我们应该庆幸住在一艘船旁边
we should be glad we live near a boat.

21
00:00:45,520 --> 00:00:47,700
很好 三票支持把船搞掉
Okay, so, that's three for "get rid of the boat."

22
00:00:47,760 --> 00:00:48,960
-卢克你呢 -别算我
- Luke? - Count me out.

23
00:00:49,020 --> 00:00:50,040
美国不是警察国家
This isn't a police state.

24
00:00:50,080 --> 00:00:51,440
那艘船又没伤害人
That boat isn't hurting anyone.

25
00:00:52,720 --> 00:00:54,800
关于那艘船你只需要知道
Here's all you need to know about that boat.

26
00:00:54,904 --> 00:00:58,840
一 塔米·拉方丹在上面晒日光浴
One -- Tammy Lafontaine sunbathes on it.

27
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:02,340
二 我的眼睛喜欢看她在上面晒日光浴
Two -- my eyeballs like looking at Tammy Lafontaine sunbathing.

28
00:01:03,140 --> 00:01:04,540
别逼我当坏人
Don't make me the bad guy here.

29
00:01:04,540 --> 00:01:06,620
你自己也讨厌那玩意儿
You know that obnoxious thing annoys you, too.

30
00:01:06,700 --> 00:01:08,500
我是讨厌 但我们得用点计谋
Yeah, it does, but we need to finesse this --

31
00:01:08,740 --> 00:01:09,560
那就是友善地处理
Be nice about it.

32
00:01:09,560 --> 00:01:10,217
我们真的不该
The last thing we need

33
00:01:10,217 --> 00:01:12,140
跟我们的疯邻居长期争执不休
is some huge feud with our crazy neighbors.

34
00:01:12,140 --> 00:01:12,740
电影创意
Movie idea.

35
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:13,900
我去写在创意清单上
I'll put on the list.

36
00:01:14,180 --> 00:01:14,800
喜剧类还是剧情类
Comedy or drama?

37
00:01:15,080 --> 00:01:15,880
取决于谁来演
Depends on casting.

38
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:17,717
肯定有这方面的规定吧
There's got to be some kind of regulation about this.

39
00:01:17,717 --> 00:01:18,720
我要给市政厅打电话
I'm gonna call the city.

40
00:01:18,720 --> 00:01:19,595
这主意太糟糕了
That's a terrible idea.

41
00:01:19,595 --> 00:01:21,320
不 关于一个能把自己
Uh, no, a terrible idea

42
00:01:21,320 --> 00:01:24,240
传真到不同地方的人的电影才糟糕
is a movie about a guy who can fax himself places.

43
00:01:24,640 --> 00:01:26,840
因为你不知道电影名叫《传真侠》
'cause you haven't heard the title -- "Just the fax man."

44
00:01:28,380 --> 00:01:29,860
海浪怎么不能来得更快些
That water can't hit us soon enough.

45
00:01:45,080 --> 00:01:46,538
你们上哪儿去了
Hey, where have you guys been?

46
00:01:46,538 --> 00:01:48,620
公共图书馆圣文森特分馆
The San Vicente branch of the public library,

47
00:01:48,620 --> 00:01:49,540
然后去吃了冰激凌
and then ice cream.

48
00:01:50,440 --> 00:01:52,180
回答具体得很诡异啊
That was a weirdly specific answer.

49
00:01:52,660 --> 00:01:53,820
一切都很正常啊
Well, everything is normal.

50
00:01:53,820 --> 00:01:55,020
通常当一切正常时
Usually when everything is normal,

51
00:01:55,240 --> 00:01:56,080
人们不会回答得这么一致
people don't respond in

52
00:01:56,080 --> 00:01:57,160
像排练过一样
perfectly rehearsed unison.

53
00:01:57,280 --> 00:01:58,820
看现在是谁具体得诡异了
Now who's being weirdly specific.

54
00:01:59,900 --> 00:02:00,978
如果你们真去了图书馆
Well, if you went to the library,

55
00:02:00,978 --> 00:02:01,980
为什么手里没书呢
why don't you have any books?

56
00:02:01,980 --> 00:02:02,720
我们在那儿看的
We read there.

57
00:02:02,780 --> 00:02:04,260
我读的是《大红狗克利福德》
I read "Clifford the Big Red Dog."

58
00:02:04,320 --> 00:02:06,160
我读的是理查德·张伯伦的自传
And I read Richard Chamberlain's autobiography.

59
00:02:06,240 --> 00:02:08,300
你知道他曾在伦敦表演哈姆雷特吗
Did you know he did Hamlet in London?

60
00:02:08,600 --> 00:02:10,640
知道 我记得你在公共图书馆
Yes, I remember you telling me about that

61
00:02:10,640 --> 00:02:12,800
圣文森特分馆跟我说过这事
at the San Vicente branch of the public library.

62
00:02:13,040 --> 00:02:14,640
去收拾一下你的房间吧 亲爱的
Okay, well, why don't you go clean your room now, sweetie?

63
00:02:14,760 --> 00:02:15,320
好主意
Great idea.

64
00:02:15,620 --> 00:02:16,640
莉莉 别忘了你的背包
Lily, don't forget your backpack.

65
00:02:17,360 --> 00:02:18,620
这是什么
Whoa, what's this?

66
00:02:19,520 --> 00:02:21,165
小卡 小丑道具
Cam, clown supplies?

67
00:02:21,165 --> 00:02:22,320
没错 那是我的
Uh, yeah, those are mine.

68
00:02:22,320 --> 00:02:24,240
我们去干洗店取的
We just had to pick them up from the dry cleaner.

69
00:02:24,540 --> 00:02:25,280
那也是我的
Also mine.

70
00:02:25,740 --> 00:02:27,100
天呐 他们肯定是
Oh, my gosh, they must

71
00:02:27,100 --> 00:02:29,580
用水洗导致衣服都缩水了
have shrunk them in the wash!

72
00:02:29,580 --> 00:02:31,780
他们洗了4万遍吗
Did they wash them 40,000 times?

73
00:02:32,220 --> 00:02:33,020
好了 听我说
Okay, look.

74
00:02:33,020 --> 00:02:35,080
没什么大不了 但今天早上我带莉莉
It's no big deal, but I took Lily

75
00:02:35,080 --> 00:02:37,160
去上儿童小丑学校
to a junior clown college this morning.

76
00:02:37,240 --> 00:02:39,060
你说真的吗 背着我带她去的
Are you serious? Behind my back?

77
00:02:39,100 --> 00:02:40,300
没错 因为我知道你不会同意的
Yes, because I knew you wouldn't approve.

78
00:02:40,320 --> 00:02:41,580
那我该怎么做
What was I supposed to do?

79
00:02:41,640 --> 00:02:43,160
别带她去啊 你也知道
Not take her because you know

80
00:02:43,160 --> 00:02:44,560
我有多不喜欢这些无聊的东西
how I feel about all this mumbo jumbo.

81
00:02:45,840 --> 00:02:47,899
那就像是我的父亲一样
Mumbo Jumbo was like a father to me.

82
00:02:47,899 --> 00:02:50,360
我已经跟你说得很清楚了
I have been very up front with you.

83
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:51,760
你非常了解
You knew going in

84
00:02:51,760 --> 00:02:54,640
我希望把我们的孩子培养成一个小丑
that I wanted to raise our child as a clown.

85
00:02:54,740 --> 00:02:55,940
没错 但后来我终于
Yes, but then I finally

86
00:02:55,940 --> 00:02:57,360
意识到你不是开玩笑的
realized that you weren't joking

87
00:02:57,820 --> 00:02:58,800
而且我们也同意会等她长大
and we agreed that we would wait

88
00:02:58,800 --> 00:03:00,540
能够自己做决定的时候再说
until she was old enough to decide for herself.

89
00:03:00,700 --> 00:03:02,260
你总是跟她在一起做各种事情
You do stuff with her all the time,

90
00:03:02,260 --> 00:03:04,260
也从没问过我是否同意
and you don't ask me for my permission.

91
00:03:04,260 --> 00:03:05,100
就在上周
Just last week,

92
00:03:05,160 --> 00:03:07,209
你带她去看医生 连问都没问我
you took her to the doctor without even asking!

93
00:03:07,209 --> 00:03:08,860
因为她耳朵感染了
'cause she had an ear infection!

94
00:03:08,860 --> 00:03:10,320
算我们扯平了
Let's say we're even!

95
00:03:13,760 --> 00:03:14,240
太棒了
Bravo!

96
00:03:14,580 --> 00:03:16,440
你吃光了所有的蓝莓
You ate all of your blueberries!

97
00:03:16,440 --> 00:03:17,900
那就能获得掌声吗
That gets applause?

98
00:03:18,380 --> 00:03:19,320
我刚做完了周五的纵横字谜
I just finished the Friday

99
00:03:19,320 --> 00:03:20,560
大家毫无反应
crossword puzzle and nothing.

100
00:03:20,980 --> 00:03:21,840
所有人都知道
I guess everyone knows

101
00:03:21,840 --> 00:03:22,960
总统赫伯特·胡佛的中间名吗
Herbert Hoover's middle name.

102
00:03:23,060 --> 00:03:23,800
看看我买了什么
Look what I got --

103
00:03:24,600 --> 00:03:26,240
我们小国王的宝座
A throne for our little king.

104
00:03:26,960 --> 00:03:28,800
非得把马桶放在桌子上吗
Do we have to put the toilet on the counter?

105
00:03:28,940 --> 00:03:30,340
我在这里喝午后咖啡的
I take my afternoon coffee here.

106
00:03:30,360 --> 00:03:32,040
一次解决一个问题吧
Let's fix one problem at a time.

107
00:03:32,500 --> 00:03:33,900
我打算对乔进行如厕训练
I've decided to potty-train Joe.

108
00:03:34,080 --> 00:03:35,200
不 太早了
No, too soon.

109
00:03:35,280 --> 00:03:37,060
现在说珍珠港的笑话还太早
It's too soon for a Pearl Harbor joke,

110
00:03:37,260 --> 00:03:38,180
做如厕训练再合适不过了
perfect time for this.

111
00:03:38,880 --> 00:03:40,240
我不想催促他
I don't want to rush him.

112
00:03:40,280 --> 00:03:42,920
如果压力太大 他会受到精神创伤的
Too much pressure and he will get traumatized.

113
00:03:42,920 --> 00:03:45,600
他是喝着比自己头还大的胸部的奶长大的
He's grown up drinking from a breast bigger than his head.

114
00:03:45,900 --> 00:03:46,920
我觉得他不容易被吓到
I don't think he scares easy.

115
00:03:47,720 --> 00:03:49,620
这孩子准备好了 而且要我说实话
The kid's ready, plus, if I'm being honest,

116
00:03:49,700 --> 00:03:51,240
我受够了买尿布
I'm tired of buying diapers.

117
00:03:52,240 --> 00:03:54,320
请问尿布在哪里
Excuse me, where do you keep the diapers?

118
00:03:54,740 --> 00:03:56,360
这边 先生
Right over here, sir.

119
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:02,820
你在搞笑吗
You trying to be funny?

120
00:04:04,060 --> 00:04:05,520
我们还有更大的尺码
We have larger sizes.

121
00:04:06,848 --> 00:04:08,240
他会表现出色的
He's gonna do great.

122
00:04:08,240 --> 00:04:08,900
当然
Why wouldn't he?

123
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:10,560
没人比乔更棒了 对吧
There's no one better than Joe, right?

124
00:04:11,340 --> 00:04:12,660
我就比乔更棒
I'm better than Joe.

125
00:04:12,980 --> 00:04:13,338
在他那么大时
At his age,

126
00:04:13,338 --> 00:04:15,460
我就会用三种语言从一数到十了
I was counting to 10 in three languages.

127
00:04:15,460 --> 00:04:17,520
那孩子的标准[棍子]真低
The bar is so low for that kid,

128
00:04:17,620 --> 00:04:18,740
除了他们玩过横棍的时候
except when they play limbo.

129
00:04:18,880 --> 00:04:21,360
他们把棍子举得好高 谁都能过去
they hold it up so high anybody can get under it.

130
00:04:24,020 --> 00:04:25,340
我没看见你躺在这里呢
I didn't see you there.

131
00:04:25,840 --> 00:04:26,240
真的吗
Really?

132
00:04:26,740 --> 00:04:28,320
上周一直在窗户里
So, is that your creepy twin brother

133
00:04:28,320 --> 00:04:29,180
盯着我看的
who's been staring at me

134
00:04:29,180 --> 00:04:30,340
是你的变态双胞胎兄弟吗
from the window for the last week?

135
00:04:30,362 --> 00:04:33,843
我可以撒谎说"是"
Uh, I could lie and say "Yes."

136
00:04:34,100 --> 00:04:35,700
你可以装作你没觉得高兴
You could pretend you weren't flattered,

137
00:04:35,940 --> 00:04:37,656
但我们何不直入主题呢
but why not just cut to the chase?

138
00:04:37,656 --> 00:04:39,177
那是什么
And what would that be?

139
00:04:40,940 --> 00:04:42,859
我可以摸摸你的一些东西吗
I could maybe touch something of yours?

140
00:04:42,859 --> 00:04:45,480
当然啦 我也可以踢你的一些东西
Sure, and I could maybe kick something of yours.

141
00:04:45,480 --> 00:04:46,500
我喜欢我们之间这么紧张
I like this tension.

142
00:04:46,860 --> 00:04:48,920
很有"他们会吗 什么时候"的感觉
Very "Will they, when will they?"

143
00:04:49,100 --> 00:04:50,260
回你的房间去 小男孩
Go back to your room, little boy.

144
00:04:50,520 --> 00:04:52,340
知道了 我到上面去看你
Got it. I'll see you from there.

145
00:04:53,408 --> 00:04:54,500
一旦我们这样接近他们
Once we approach them with this,

146
00:04:54,500 --> 00:04:56,080
我会很难跟市政府
it's gonna be awfully hard for me to log in

147
00:04:56,080 --> 00:04:57,395
打匿名电话了
with my anonymous call to the city.

148
00:04:57,395 --> 00:04:59,808
你没必要举报任何人
You're not gonna have to report anyone.

149
00:04:59,880 --> 00:05:00,998
叫我大卫·科波菲尔吧
Call me David Copperfield,

150
00:05:00,998 --> 00:05:03,580
因为我就要让一艘船消失了
'cause I'm about to make a boat disappear.

151
00:05:03,580 --> 00:05:06,200
邻居们 我给你们做了点香蕉面包
Hey, neighbors. I made you some banana bread.

152
00:05:06,499 --> 00:05:08,320
我喜欢香蕉面包
Oh, I love banana bread.

153
00:05:08,320 --> 00:05:09,580
我们的药房里也有这个
We have this at our dispensary,

154
00:05:09,580 --> 00:05:10,780
不过里面会加大麻
except we got weed in it.

155
00:05:11,040 --> 00:05:13,260
但我们可以把你的面包给孩子们来耍他们
But we could give this one to our kids as a trick.

156
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:16,020
这艘船真不错啊
This boat is really something.

157
00:05:16,180 --> 00:05:17,820
你知道我们怎么称呼她吗
You know what we call her?

158
00:05:18,148 --> 00:05:20,119
-"头奖" -因为你卖大麻
- "Jackpot"! - 'Cause you sell pot.

159
00:05:20,180 --> 00:05:22,340
天啊 我们从来没想到这一点
Holy cow, we never thought of that.

160
00:05:22,680 --> 00:05:24,240
这是我这辈子最棒的一天
This is the best day of my life!

161
00:05:24,560 --> 00:05:26,440
我可以登上来好好瞧瞧她吗
Permission to come aboard and check her out?

162
00:05:26,860 --> 00:05:27,300
当然可以
Yeah!

163
00:05:27,460 --> 00:05:30,000
前提是你说的是我的船 而不是我妻子
That is, if you're talking about my boat and not my wife.

164
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:32,045
是啊 你可不能登上我
Ooh, yeah, you can't climb aboard me.

165
00:05:32,045 --> 00:05:33,927
反正在车道上不行
Well, not in the driveway, anyway.

166
00:05:34,110 --> 00:05:36,827
-这真是太棒了 -是啊
- This is so great. - Yeah.

167
00:05:36,827 --> 00:05:38,058
你去做了头发吗
Did you do something new with your hair?

168
00:05:38,058 --> 00:05:39,585
买了一顶新假发还是怎么
Did you get a new wig or something?

169
00:05:40,520 --> 00:05:43,380
这种漂亮的小船就该下水 对吧
Sweet boat like this belongs in the water, am I right?

170
00:05:43,600 --> 00:05:45,620
把船推下水的人们
Well, you know, people who put their boat in the water,

171
00:05:45,680 --> 00:05:46,740
只能在周末使用船
they only use it on the weekend.

172
00:05:46,740 --> 00:05:48,680
而我们每天都可以用
We get to use this baby every day.

173
00:05:48,740 --> 00:05:49,860
你能想象
Can you imagine

174
00:05:49,860 --> 00:05:52,000
每天都去码头上找这艘船吗
visiting this boat every day in the marina?

175
00:05:52,220 --> 00:05:53,460
你花了很多钱买的东西
You spend a bunch of money on something,

176
00:05:53,480 --> 00:05:54,600
就要让人们看见
you want people to see it.

177
00:05:54,780 --> 00:05:56,220
所以我穿着低胸上衣
That's why I wear low-cut tops.

178
00:05:57,460 --> 00:05:58,460
是啊 听好了
Yeah! Listen up.

179
00:05:58,900 --> 00:06:00,040
我得说实话
I just got to be honest.

180
00:06:00,060 --> 00:06:01,420
我们对这艘船很有意见
We're having a hard time with the boat here.

181
00:06:01,917 --> 00:06:03,620
什么 你不喜欢"头奖"吗
What, you don't like Jackpot?

182
00:06:03,620 --> 00:06:05,980
它太大了 让我们很难
It's gigantic and makes it pretty tough

183
00:06:05,980 --> 00:06:07,100
在我们的车道上停车
to park in our driveway.

184
00:06:07,860 --> 00:06:10,727
那是因为你们侵犯到我们的车道了
Well, that's because you open your doors onto our driveway,

185
00:06:10,727 --> 00:06:13,120
我们的船停在这里
where we keep our boat.

186
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:15,860
是啊 根据城市规定
Yes, and, according to city regulations,

187
00:06:16,360 --> 00:06:17,380
它不该出现在这里
it shouldn't even be here.

188
00:06:17,700 --> 00:06:18,940
规定 听到了吗
"Regulations." Hear that?

189
00:06:19,020 --> 00:06:20,740
听着 我们真的想保持友好
Look, we really do want to keep this friendly.

190
00:06:20,820 --> 00:06:22,780
这船都在这里停了三周了
And it's been here for three weeks.

191
00:06:22,820 --> 00:06:24,780
-是的 它很美 -很俗气
- Yeah, and it's beautiful. - And it's tacky.

192
00:06:25,946 --> 00:06:27,435
-冷静点 -你的话太难听了
- Settle down! - Hey, that is uncool!

193
00:06:27,435 --> 00:06:29,645
船身上画着四张大A呢
There are four aces on the side of it.

194
00:06:30,040 --> 00:06:30,757
这样吧
You know what?

195
00:06:30,757 --> 00:06:32,678
我们现在要求你们上岸
We're gonna have to ask you to disembark.

196
00:06:32,678 --> 00:06:34,340
那是"滚开"的船上用语
That's boat for "Get off."

197
00:06:34,340 --> 00:06:37,500
是的 这里不欢迎让人讨厌又扫兴的人
Yeah, there's no room up here for an uptight buzzkill.

198
00:06:37,600 --> 00:06:38,760
不许说她让人扫兴
Don't call her a buzzkill.

199
00:06:38,880 --> 00:06:40,199
没错 很多人认为我很风趣
That's right. There's a lot of people who think I'm fun.

200
00:06:40,199 --> 00:06:42,155
你抱怨星期五的烟火表演
You complain about fireworks Friday,

201
00:06:42,155 --> 00:06:44,760
我儿子敲鼓的时候你也抱怨
you complain when my son plays his kick-ass drum set,

202
00:06:44,760 --> 00:06:46,600
你买了窗帘挂在卧室的窗户上
you bought curtains for your bedroom window.

203
00:06:47,520 --> 00:06:48,740
我们对你们做什么了吗
What have we ever done to you?

204
00:06:48,760 --> 00:06:50,538
我想你回答了你自己的问题
I think you just answered your own question.

205
00:06:50,538 --> 00:06:51,091
好 这样吧
All right, you know what?

206
00:06:51,460 --> 00:06:53,140
把你那半生不熟的香蕉面包拿走
Here, take your buzz-free banana bread

207
00:06:53,140 --> 00:06:54,565
回你们那宝贵的车道去
and go back to your precious driveway.

208
00:06:54,565 --> 00:06:55,220
很乐意
With pleasure.

209
00:06:55,220 --> 00:06:55,940
还有 克莱尔
By the way, Claire,

210
00:06:55,940 --> 00:06:57,280
刚才我只是想表示友善
earlier, I was just being nice.

211
00:06:57,280 --> 00:06:58,860
其实我根本不喜欢你的新假发
I do not like your new wig.

212
00:06:58,860 --> 00:07:01,480
你不喜欢的是她的真头发
Hey, what you don't like is her real hair!

213
00:07:01,580 --> 00:07:02,980
-菲尔 -颜色是染的
- Phil! - Uh, not the color.

214
00:07:03,300 --> 00:07:03,760
菲尔
Hey, Phil!

215
00:07:06,120 --> 00:07:07,340
你还认为我们应该态度好一些吗
Still think we need to be nice?

216
00:07:07,480 --> 00:07:09,260
不 是时候拿出强硬手段了
No. It's time for more drastic measures.

217
00:07:09,800 --> 00:07:12,260
没人可以羞辱我的香蕉面包
No one insults... my banana bread.

218
00:07:19,406 --> 00:07:21,939
-米奇尔 -菲茨 不 不要
- Mitchell. - F-fiz-- no! No!

219
00:07:22,140 --> 00:07:23,880
我告诉过你不要偷偷接近我
What have I said about you sneaking up on me?

220
00:07:23,900 --> 00:07:24,620
我可能在剃胡子
I could have been shaving.

221
00:07:24,760 --> 00:07:25,980
场面可能会像《理发师陶德》里一样
This could have been a sweeney Todd moment.

222
00:07:25,980 --> 00:07:29,060
莉莉继承了我扮小丑的才华
Because of me, clowning is in Lily's blood.

223
00:07:29,300 --> 00:07:29,680
她是领养的
Adopted.

224
00:07:29,840 --> 00:07:32,020
但她有天赋 我们会证明给你看的
But she's a natural, and we're gonna prove it to you.

225
00:07:32,020 --> 00:07:34,240
如果她不能逗你笑
If she doesn't make you laugh,

226
00:07:34,400 --> 00:07:35,600
那她就再也不扮小丑
she'll quit clowning forever.

227
00:07:35,800 --> 00:07:36,340
求你了
Come on.

228
00:07:36,540 --> 00:07:36,980
来嘛
Please.

229
00:07:38,160 --> 00:07:41,960
我向你介绍大众皆宜的亚洲面孔
I present to you the Asian for any occasion,

230
00:07:42,180 --> 00:07:44,320
会让你转怒为喜的小丑
the clown that will invert that frown,

231
00:07:44,580 --> 00:07:47,980
活力四射二人组 菲茨宝和...
the dynamic duo of Fizbo and...

232
00:07:49,320 --> 00:07:49,880
莉茨宝[似Limbo: 地狱]
Lizbo!

233
00:07:50,480 --> 00:07:51,620
你没听出来吗
Are you not hearing that?

234
00:07:51,820 --> 00:07:52,940
名字我们还在研究
We're working on the name.

235
00:07:55,420 --> 00:07:58,280
不 菲茨宝的帽子掉了
Oh, no, Fizbo dropped his hat.

236
00:07:58,400 --> 00:08:00,000
它去哪了 莉茨宝
Where did it go, Lizbo?

237
00:08:00,420 --> 00:08:01,320
在那里
It's right there.

238
00:08:02,500 --> 00:08:03,600
在这里呢
There it is!

239
00:08:06,320 --> 00:08:08,080
不 菲茨宝 不要
No, Fizbo! No!

240
00:08:08,100 --> 00:08:10,920
怎么了 我拿回了我的帽子 莉茨宝
What? I'm just putting my hat back on, Lizbo.

241
00:08:12,100 --> 00:08:13,300
天呐
Oh, my --

242
00:08:13,504 --> 00:08:14,035
五彩纸屑
Confetti --

243
00:08:14,035 --> 00:08:16,010
希望菲茨宝知道怎么用吸尘器
I hope Fizbo knows how to vacuum.

244
00:08:16,797 --> 00:08:18,700
谁把灯关了
Who turned out the lights?!

245
00:08:18,700 --> 00:08:19,860
你把那些弄得到处都是
You're just spreading it around.

246
00:08:24,220 --> 00:08:26,140
我试着对莉莉表示支持
I tried to be supportive for Lily.

247
00:08:26,200 --> 00:08:29,020
我真的尝试了 但是我真的想死
I really did, but I wanted to kill myself.

248
00:08:38,100 --> 00:08:39,460
固定节目里没有这段
That's not part of the routine.

249
00:08:44,300 --> 00:08:46,220
她真有天赋 再来一次
She's a natural. Do it again.

250
00:08:48,860 --> 00:08:51,320
好的 来吧 不要紧
Okay, here we go. Nothing to it.

251
00:08:52,180 --> 00:08:53,800
尿吧
Make it rain.

252
00:08:55,224 --> 00:08:55,900
好的 我明白
Yeah, I-I get it.

253
00:08:55,900 --> 00:08:57,940
有别人看着你 你尿不出来
You -- you can't pee with another guy looking at you.

254
00:08:58,300 --> 00:08:59,880
这不是什么坏事 顺便说一句
Not a bad thing, by the way.

255
00:09:02,540 --> 00:09:04,780
老天 胡佛的中间名原来是克拉克
Son of a gun, his middle name was Clark.

256
00:09:05,427 --> 00:09:06,180
杰
Jay!

257
00:09:06,180 --> 00:09:07,740
能给我们留点隐私吗
May we have some privacy, please?

258
00:09:07,800 --> 00:09:08,340
为什么
For what?

259
00:09:08,500 --> 00:09:11,660
这样乔就可以继续咬电线了吗
So that Joe can keep chewing on the electrical cord?

260
00:09:13,012 --> 00:09:15,000
我们 我们不为这鼓掌吗
O-oh, we're -- we're not clapping for this?

261
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:17,720
我跟你说过他没准备好
I told you that he was not ready, and when he is,

262
00:09:17,740 --> 00:09:19,780
为什么不让他母亲来照看他呢
why don't you let his mother take care of it?

263
00:09:19,780 --> 00:09:22,060
要知道 我养育了两个正常的孩子
You know, I raised two fully functional children.

264
00:09:22,060 --> 00:09:23,820
你还有两个我不知道的孩子吗
You have two kids that I don't know about?

265
00:09:24,060 --> 00:09:27,035
拜托 就让乔按部就班长大吧
Please, just let Joe go on his own schedule.

266
00:09:27,035 --> 00:09:30,150
曼尼两岁半才学会用座便
Manny learned to potty-train when he was 2 1/2.

267
00:09:30,320 --> 00:09:31,940
你跟我说是十三个月的时候
You told me it was 13 months.

268
00:09:31,940 --> 00:09:33,753
我可能是有点夸张了
I may have exaggerated a little bit.

269
00:09:33,753 --> 00:09:35,528
两岁半一点也不超前
2 1/2 isn't advanced at all.

270
00:09:36,220 --> 00:09:37,617
你还夸张了什么事
What else did you exaggerate?

271
00:09:37,617 --> 00:09:39,546
我三岁的时候真的喜欢莎士比亚吗
Did I really like Shakespeare when I was 3?

272
00:09:39,546 --> 00:09:41,680
比起莎士比亚来 你更喜欢果冻
Not so much Shakespeare as Jello.

273
00:09:41,680 --> 00:09:43,198
我说的第一个词真的是"拿铁"吗
Was my first word really "Latte"?

274
00:09:43,198 --> 00:09:45,168
不是"拿铁" 是"果冻"
Not so much "Latte" as "Jello."

275
00:09:45,168 --> 00:09:47,020
天呐 我就是个正常人
Oh, my god. I'm normal.

276
00:09:47,020 --> 00:09:48,880
相信我 孩子 没人觉得你正常
Trust me, kid, no one's saying that about you.

277
00:09:49,340 --> 00:09:50,920
那你为什么要那样跟我说
Why did you tell me all those things?

278
00:09:51,100 --> 00:09:52,060
为了提升你的自信心
To give you confidence.

279
00:09:52,180 --> 00:09:53,460
你很需要自信 因为当时
You needed it because you were having

280
00:09:53,460 --> 00:09:55,560
你学识字遇到了很大的困难
so much trouble learning how to read.

281
00:09:55,760 --> 00:09:56,799
这说不通啊
This makes no sense.

282
00:09:56,799 --> 00:09:59,221
是的 你以前也总这么说
Yes, that what you always used to say.

283
00:10:07,340 --> 00:10:08,640
我并没有灰心
I wasn't deterred.

284
00:10:08,760 --> 00:10:11,580
我知道莉莉拥有成为优秀小丑的天份
I knew Lily had what it took to be a great clown.

285
00:10:11,760 --> 00:10:12,380
还用问吗
I mean...

286
00:10:13,300 --> 00:10:14,600
她只是需要找到适合自己的形象
She just needed to find her persona,

287
00:10:14,600 --> 00:10:18,760
过程可能会很痛苦 尤其对我来说
and that process can be painful, especially for me.

288
00:10:24,629 --> 00:10:25,776
莉莉
Ohh, Lily!

289
00:10:40,140 --> 00:10:42,000
早安 邻居们
Good morning, neighbors.

290
00:10:42,340 --> 00:10:43,660
天气真好
Beautiful day, huh?

291
00:10:43,660 --> 00:10:45,960
嘴里抹了蜜也没用
Don't even try to sweet-talk us.

292
00:10:46,360 --> 00:10:47,800
这艘俗船哪里也不会去
This tacky boat ain't going anywhere.

293
00:10:48,900 --> 00:10:49,780
那是什么
Hey, what's that?

294
00:10:50,480 --> 00:10:53,220
我不知道 会是什么呢
I don't know. What could it be?

295
00:10:57,860 --> 00:10:59,559
菲尔不是那种报复心很重的人
Phil is not a vindictive guy.

296
00:10:59,559 --> 00:11:01,320
他现在还会听米利瓦尼利的歌
He still listens to Milli Vanilli.

297
00:11:01,320 --> 00:11:03,020
我可以对着这丑闻起舞
It's a scandal I can dance to.

298
00:11:03,500 --> 00:11:05,260
可罗尼和安布尔不配见友好版菲尔
But Ronnie and Amber don't deserve nice Phil.

299
00:11:05,340 --> 00:11:06,100
他们对我的女人不敬
They dissed my woman,

300
00:11:06,100 --> 00:11:07,280
所以我请了大人物来对付他们
so I called in the big guns.

301
00:11:07,600 --> 00:11:09,420
你现在真性感
You are so sexy right now.

302
00:11:09,540 --> 00:11:11,060
姑娘 你知道事实如此[米利瓦尼利经典歌名]
Girl, you know it's true.

303
00:11:11,180 --> 00:11:12,020
又恢复老样子了
Oh, there it goes.

304
00:11:15,900 --> 00:11:17,540
那是我儿子吗
Is that my son

305
00:11:17,720 --> 00:11:20,160
还是世界上最让人心花怒放的镜子
or am I looking in the world's most flattering mirror?

306
00:11:20,300 --> 00:11:21,800
真是风趣又振奋人心
That's funny and uplifting!

307
00:11:22,620 --> 00:11:22,740
当然
It is!

308
00:11:24,440 --> 00:11:25,739
多谢你这么快就过来
Thanks for coming so fast.

309
00:11:25,739 --> 00:11:26,840
我们打给你的时候你在哪
Oh. Where were you when we called?

310
00:11:26,840 --> 00:11:28,100
谁知道 看起来都一样
Who knows? It all looks the same.

311
00:11:28,160 --> 00:11:29,700
不是亚利桑那州就是新墨西哥州
Either Arizona or New Mexico.

312
00:11:29,700 --> 00:11:31,620
甚至有可能是真的墨西哥
Or maybe even regular Mexico.

313
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:33,380
多谢你们能来 各位
Thanks for coming, fellas.

314
00:11:33,394 --> 00:11:35,300
-你们好 -爷爷
- Hey, guys. - Grandpa!

315
00:11:35,300 --> 00:11:37,660
我的小姑娘们来了 你们好吗
There's my little girls. How are you?

316
00:11:38,620 --> 00:11:40,000
这是什么意思
What the hell is this?

317
00:11:40,260 --> 00:11:41,600
我们看到你停车位上的船
We see your driveway boat

318
00:11:41,600 --> 00:11:44,400
所以帮你找了群退休老人来护航
and raise you a convoy of retirees.

319
00:11:44,880 --> 00:11:46,480
我想再给你生三个孩子
Oh, I want to have three more of your babies.

320
00:11:47,380 --> 00:11:48,220
你的自驾游怎么样
How was your road trip?

321
00:11:48,600 --> 00:11:50,429
亮点在密苏里州的布兰森
The highlight came in Branson, Missouri,

322
00:11:50,429 --> 00:11:54,140
维克托追尾了雅科夫·斯米诺夫的越野车
when Victor rear-ended Yakov Smirnoff's S.U.V.

323
00:11:54,140 --> 00:11:56,880
交换信息的过程超搞笑
The exchange of information was hilarious,

324
00:11:56,880 --> 00:11:58,080
但也很累人
but frustrating.

325
00:11:58,180 --> 00:11:59,900
我完全听不懂发生了什么
I don't understand anything that's happening.

326
00:12:00,260 --> 00:12:01,360
"在我的国家
"In my country,

327
00:12:01,380 --> 00:12:03,540
车给我上保险"
car has insurance for me."

328
00:12:03,680 --> 00:12:04,620
这一类的
that sort of thing.

329
00:12:04,980 --> 00:12:05,962
笑就好了
Just laugh.

330
00:12:05,962 --> 00:12:07,631
某天我们会怀念这个时刻的
One day, we'll treasure these moments.

331
00:12:08,560 --> 00:12:10,480
你们说服我了
I guess you guys convinced us.

332
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:13,040
在前院里摆一个大型消遣性交通工具
It's awesome having Giant recreational vehicles

333
00:12:13,040 --> 00:12:14,100
真的很棒
in your front yard.

334
00:12:14,400 --> 00:12:16,135
我们知道你们打什么主意了
Oh, we see what you two are doing.

335
00:12:16,135 --> 00:12:17,420
好戏还在后面呢
You're gonna see a whole lot more,

336
00:12:17,420 --> 00:12:20,840
这些老家伙们喜欢穿着短款睡袍耍太极
'cause these old guys like to do Tai Chi in shorty robes.

337
00:12:21,120 --> 00:12:23,576
没用的 我喜欢跟老人家玩
This ain't gonna work. I like hanging with old people.

338
00:12:23,860 --> 00:12:24,760
让我感觉自己身材特好
Makes me feel in-shape.

339
00:12:25,020 --> 00:12:27,336
他们睡不着还听不见
They can't sleep and they can't hear.

340
00:12:27,336 --> 00:12:29,720
所以会整晚都开着收音机
They're gonna be blasting talk radio all night long.

341
00:12:29,720 --> 00:12:32,600
我喝醉以后打呼特别响
When I get drunk, I snore real loud,

342
00:12:32,600 --> 00:12:34,060
所以什么都听不见
so I won't hear a thing.

343
00:12:34,420 --> 00:12:35,720
我们就是想让你体会一下
We just wanted to give you a taste

344
00:12:35,720 --> 00:12:37,500
跟你做邻居是什么感觉
of what it's like to have you for a neighbor.

345
00:12:38,140 --> 00:12:40,909
我喜欢我们的嘴凑这么近
I love how close together all our mouths are.

346
00:12:40,909 --> 00:12:41,536
好吧
Okay.

347
00:12:41,536 --> 00:12:42,438
爸 那个
Hey, dad, what's the --

348
00:12:42,600 --> 00:12:45,640
丽塔·海华丝那个电影讲啥来着
What's the plot of that Rita Hayworth movie?

349
00:12:46,200 --> 00:12:47,300
我朋友很想知道
My friends here were wondering.

350
00:12:47,380 --> 00:12:47,940
我们的暗号
That's my cue.

351
00:12:48,120 --> 00:12:49,619
该去帮我儿子处理船的事了
Time to help my boy get rid of a boat.

352
00:12:49,619 --> 00:12:52,540
《上海小姐》
Uh, "Lady from Shanghai"?

353
00:12:52,540 --> 00:12:53,397
就是那部
That's the one.

354
00:12:53,397 --> 00:12:55,660
我记不清细节了
I-I can't remember all the details.

355
00:12:55,660 --> 00:12:57,459
不过里面肯定有匹马
Pretty sure there was a horse in that movie.

356
00:12:57,459 --> 00:12:59,140
还是个婴儿来着
Or was it a baby?

357
00:12:59,140 --> 00:13:01,600
搞笑的是 这些都不在上海
Funny thing -- none of it was in Shanghai.

358
00:13:01,600 --> 00:13:03,680
还是都在上海来着
Or was all of it in Shanghai?

359
00:13:03,721 --> 00:13:05,860
好吧 我讲到哪里了 对了
Anyway, where was I? Oh, right.

360
00:13:05,860 --> 00:13:08,080
所以 不管是马还是婴儿
So, either the horse or this baby...

361
00:13:10,400 --> 00:13:12,020
我要把这些放进车里
I'm just putting these in the car.

362
00:13:12,380 --> 00:13:14,240
我帮穷人家的孩子练举重
I help underprivileged kids lift weights.

363
00:13:14,340 --> 00:13:15,560
你连车都不会开呢
You can't even drive yet.

364
00:13:16,080 --> 00:13:18,500
好吧 你知道了我的秘密 你的呢
Okay, you know my secret. What's yours?

365
00:13:18,780 --> 00:13:20,560
你真觉得这种方式会有用吗
Do you honestly think any of this is gonna work?

366
00:13:22,220 --> 00:13:23,520
我不知道自己在干什么
I don't know what I'm doing.

367
00:13:25,200 --> 00:13:27,360
在你身边我都不知道该怎么说话了
I-I have no clue what to say when I'm around you,

368
00:13:27,720 --> 00:13:29,160
可我一直在想你
but I think about you all the time.

369
00:13:32,020 --> 00:13:35,780
好吧 我的秘密是这个
Fine. Here's my secret.

370
00:13:37,080 --> 00:13:39,080
我装得这么高冷
I put all these walls up and act tough,

371
00:13:39,340 --> 00:13:42,680
可其实 我从来没跟男生恋爱过
but... I've never really been with a boy before.

372
00:13:43,020 --> 00:13:43,420
真的吗
Really?

373
00:13:44,040 --> 00:13:45,560
我也没有跟女孩恋爱过
Because I've never been with a girl.

374
00:13:46,340 --> 00:13:47,700
天呐 真可悲
oh, my God. Pathetic.

375
00:13:48,080 --> 00:13:49,720
回家找妈妈去吧 小婊砸
Run home to your mommy, you little bitch.

376
00:13:54,507 --> 00:13:55,477
莉茨宝在里面吗
Is Lizbo in here?

377
00:13:55,477 --> 00:13:56,858
她应该在我们房间
I think she's in our room.

378
00:13:57,860 --> 00:13:58,260
小卡
Cam.

379
00:13:58,520 --> 00:13:59,880
如果你没有背着我行动的话
You know, you wouldn't be in this position

380
00:13:59,880 --> 00:14:01,060
就不会落到这般田地
if you hadn't gone behind my back.

381
00:14:01,060 --> 00:14:03,980
如果我丈夫足够支持我
I wouldn't be in this position if I had...

382
00:14:03,980 --> 00:14:06,360
我也不会落到这般田地
a supportive husband.

383
00:14:07,120 --> 00:14:09,800
我倒想听听看 这怎么成了我的错
Okay. Really, I would love to hear how this is my fault.

384
00:14:09,920 --> 00:14:12,260
昨天 莉莉非常用心地为你表演
Yesterday, Lily performed her heart out for you.

385
00:14:12,320 --> 00:14:14,520
能表演扫帚把戏她很激动
She was so excited to do that broom routine,

386
00:14:14,520 --> 00:14:15,760
可你毫无反应
and you gave her nothing.

387
00:14:16,460 --> 00:14:17,960
她感到失望
So she got desperate,

388
00:14:17,960 --> 00:14:19,840
于是开始做一些攻击性的表演
and she resorted to mean-spirited gags.

389
00:14:19,840 --> 00:14:21,035
接着 就在一瞬间 你猜怎么着
And then all of a sudden, guess what.

390
00:14:21,035 --> 00:14:22,860
你就成了笑笑先生[游戏人物]
You're Mister Mcgiggles!

391
00:14:22,860 --> 00:14:24,060
这个人物是不是就像你叔叔
Oh, is he like an uncle to you?

392
00:14:25,220 --> 00:14:27,440
我最失望的一点就是 我丈夫居然
You know what hurt the most is that my husband

393
00:14:27,440 --> 00:14:30,060
想让我们的女儿也讨厌我的爱好
turned our daughter against something that I love.

394
00:14:35,700 --> 00:14:37,500
我们很感激你们的帮助
Guys, we appreciate all your help,

395
00:14:37,640 --> 00:14:38,860
但你们不该在上面啊
but you probably shouldn't be up there.

396
00:14:38,920 --> 00:14:39,920
我不介意
I don't mind.

397
00:14:41,160 --> 00:14:42,700
那是大麻的味道吗
Is that weed I smell?

398
00:14:42,740 --> 00:14:44,040
你居然卖毒品给他们
Wait, you gave them pot?

399
00:14:44,160 --> 00:14:46,080
别瞎说 我的生意完全合法
No, I run a legitimate business.

400
00:14:46,200 --> 00:14:47,160
我才不会冒这个险
I'm not gonna risk it for that.

401
00:14:47,320 --> 00:14:47,920
这些是他们自带的
They brought their own.

402
00:14:48,040 --> 00:14:48,420
老爸
Dad?

403
00:14:48,640 --> 00:14:51,300
-不是我 -是我和维克托
- Not me, son. - It's me and Victor.

404
00:14:51,860 --> 00:14:54,060
这能缓解我的关节痛
Makes my arthritis feel better.

405
00:14:54,120 --> 00:14:56,560
而我还在缓解我的懒惰
And I'm in remission from being lame.

406
00:14:57,201 --> 00:14:58,111
弗兰克 你的啤酒
Here's your beer, Frank.

407
00:14:58,111 --> 00:14:59,300
-罗尼 谢谢 -不客气
- Thank you, Ronnie. - Right on.

408
00:14:59,300 --> 00:15:01,020
上菜啦 这是猪包毯
Here you go, guys. Pigs in a blanket.

409
00:15:01,020 --> 00:15:01,040
谢谢
Thank you, darling.

410
00:15:01,040 --> 00:15:03,640
你们在干什么
What are you guys doing?!

411
00:15:04,180 --> 00:15:05,760
你的任务是惹怒他们
You're supposed to be annoying them.

412
00:15:05,760 --> 00:15:07,380
-他们不会惹怒我的 -什么
- These guys could never annoy me. - What?

413
00:15:07,380 --> 00:15:09,457
罗尼
Oh, Ronnie!

414
00:15:10,600 --> 00:15:13,480
抱歉儿子 罗尼居然也当过兵
Sorry, son, it turns out Ronnie's a fellow army man.

415
00:15:13,540 --> 00:15:15,080
何况到了我们这个年纪
Plus, at our age,

416
00:15:15,080 --> 00:15:17,780
我们很难讨厌关心老人的人
it's tough not to like someone who pays attention to us.

417
00:15:18,120 --> 00:15:18,640
难以置信
Unbelievable.

418
00:15:19,360 --> 00:15:20,160
我早该猜到的
I should have known better.

419
00:15:20,322 --> 00:15:22,058
我爸就是这么受人喜爱
My dad's too loveable.

420
00:15:22,140 --> 00:15:23,500
这是他最大的缺点
It's always been his biggest flaw.

421
00:15:24,560 --> 00:15:26,400
闻上去好像在开派对啊
Hey, smells like a party!

422
00:15:26,420 --> 00:15:26,960
回屋去
Back inside.

423
00:15:27,180 --> 00:15:28,220
遵命
Okay, then.

424
00:15:36,038 --> 00:15:38,544
*乖乖坐到马桶上*
*Take your body down to the potty*

425
00:15:38,544 --> 00:15:41,381
*一起嘘嘘乐趣多*
*To have some fun and go number one*

426
00:15:43,740 --> 00:15:45,300
这都是些什么啊
What is this filth?

427
00:15:45,700 --> 00:15:46,360
我什么都试过了
I tried everything,

428
00:15:46,680 --> 00:15:48,260
视频 书籍 家教网站
videos, books, parenting websites.

429
00:15:48,400 --> 00:15:50,000
我连改编游戏都试过了
I even tried to make a game out of it.

430
00:15:50,420 --> 00:15:52,420
还是没办法让他学会用马桶
Nothing could get that kid to use the toilet.

431
00:15:52,640 --> 00:15:56,500
另外 千万别在网上搜索"尿尿游戏"
By the way, do not search "Peeing games" on the internet.

432
00:15:56,960 --> 00:15:59,360
乔 你想要什么 我不缺钱
Okay, Joe, what's it gonna be? I'm a wealthy man.

433
00:15:59,620 --> 00:16:00,500
告诉我你要多少
Just give me a number.

434
00:16:00,640 --> 00:16:01,020
七
Seven.

435
00:16:02,120 --> 00:16:03,580
我刚刚发现
I just found out that's how old I was

436
00:16:03,580 --> 00:16:04,940
原来我七岁才学会系鞋带
when I learned to tie my shoes.

437
00:16:05,052 --> 00:16:07,375
不是你告诉我的两岁
Not 2, like I was told.

438
00:16:07,800 --> 00:16:09,100
曼尼 别这样
Okay, please, Manny.

439
00:16:09,500 --> 00:16:11,320
我可能是夸张了点
I might have exaggerated a little bit,

440
00:16:11,340 --> 00:16:12,880
但我一直都这样
but I do that all the time.

441
00:16:13,079 --> 00:16:15,820
哥伦比亚其实是个很正常的国家
Columbia actually is a very normal place.

442
00:16:15,820 --> 00:16:17,660
我的成就都是假的
My accomplishments are all lies.

443
00:16:17,740 --> 00:16:20,240
我一次只能安慰一个受伤的孩子
I can only deal with one traumatized child at a time.

444
00:16:20,560 --> 00:16:23,800
杰 放过那可怜的孩子吧
Please, Jay, let that poor baby off the toilet.

445
00:16:23,900 --> 00:16:24,760
新计划
Okay, new plan--

446
00:16:25,340 --> 00:16:27,520
我们就让他待在这里直到他昏睡过去
we leave him on the throne till he conks out,

447
00:16:27,520 --> 00:16:29,980
然后把他的手放进一碗温水里
then we dunk his hand in a bowl of warm water--

448
00:16:29,980 --> 00:16:31,020
你疯了
That's crazy.

449
00:16:31,020 --> 00:16:33,658
你知道这种事急不来的
You know that you can't rush these things.

450
00:16:33,658 --> 00:16:36,266
抚养克莱尔和米奇时你经历过的
You did it before with Claire and with Mitch.

451
00:16:37,380 --> 00:16:38,680
我不这么认为
I don't think he did, mom.

452
00:16:38,840 --> 00:16:40,340
他经历过 对吧
Yes, he did, right?

453
00:16:40,420 --> 00:16:43,360
我忙着发展自己的衣柜事业
Well, I was a little busy building a closet empire.

454
00:16:43,839 --> 00:16:46,020
当时又很流行壁球
And racquetball was pretty big back then.

455
00:16:46,020 --> 00:16:48,040
也许这就是为何你如此看中此事
Maybe that's why this is so important to you.

456
00:16:48,040 --> 00:16:50,240
你错过了他们人生中的重要阶段
You missed so many milestones in their lives,

457
00:16:50,240 --> 00:16:51,820
你不想在乔的身上也发生这种事
you don't want to miss them with Joe.

458
00:16:52,100 --> 00:16:53,600
这是你的第二次机会
This is your second chance.

459
00:16:54,200 --> 00:16:56,400
别担心 杰 他知道你爱他
But don't worry, Jay. He knows you love him.

460
00:16:56,520 --> 00:16:58,700
我想让他知道 我一直在他身边
I'd like him to remember that I'm there for him.

461
00:16:59,620 --> 00:17:01,580
谁知道我还有没有第二次机会
I mean, who knows if I'll get another chance.

462
00:17:01,700 --> 00:17:03,680
我知道 你不会的
I know. You won't.

463
00:17:03,780 --> 00:17:05,700
他也不用记得这些
And he won't have to remember you

464
00:17:05,700 --> 00:17:07,520
因为你会一直在他身边
because you're always going to be here.

465
00:17:08,340 --> 00:17:09,260
忘了吧
Forget it.

466
00:17:09,380 --> 00:17:10,600
休息一下
Come on. Let's give it a rest.

467
00:17:10,800 --> 00:17:12,640
可怜的宝宝 我给了他这么大压力
The poor kid, all that pressure I put on him.

468
00:17:12,640 --> 00:17:13,600
尤其是他的膀胱
Especially his bladder.

469
00:17:14,220 --> 00:17:16,540
你肚子里估计憋了一加仑的苹果汁
You've probably got a gallon of apple juice in there, buddy.

470
00:17:17,160 --> 00:17:18,280
你发现了吗
Did you see that?

471
00:17:18,960 --> 00:17:20,560
你发现自己多么理解杰了吗
Did you see how you understood Jay?

472
00:17:21,140 --> 00:17:23,160
这就是你的特别之处
That's what makes you so special.

473
00:17:23,880 --> 00:17:25,520
任何人都可以学会走路
Anyone can learn how to walk

474
00:17:25,520 --> 00:17:26,600
或是对着尿壶撒尿
or pee in a potty.

475
00:17:26,600 --> 00:17:30,443
你是我所知的最敏感 最具洞察力的人
You're the most sensitive and insightful person I have ever known,

476
00:17:30,443 --> 00:17:32,269
你一直都是这样
and you have always been.

477
00:17:32,269 --> 00:17:33,527
过来抱抱 小宝贝
Come here, papi.

478
00:17:33,900 --> 00:17:34,560
他在撒尿
He's peeing!

479
00:17:35,060 --> 00:17:36,920
-他在撒尿 -我的小天才
- He's peeing! - My little genius!

480
00:17:37,100 --> 00:17:38,420
我就知道你能做到的 小家伙
I knew you could do it, buddy!

481
00:17:38,603 --> 00:17:40,069
杰 他还没撒完呢
ay, Jay, he's not done.

482
00:17:40,069 --> 00:17:42,085
我靠 撒我一身
Aw, hell. It's all over me.

483
00:17:42,160 --> 00:17:43,040
你能抱着他吗
Would you take him?

484
00:17:47,680 --> 00:17:48,160
莉莉
Lily!

485
00:17:48,420 --> 00:17:49,720
-是你啊 -行了
- Oh, it's you. - Okay.

486
00:17:50,060 --> 00:17:51,720
过来 来 我们好好谈谈
Come here. Come on. Let's have a little talk.

487
00:17:51,900 --> 00:17:54,660
听着 我知道你在对大爸
All right, I know that I have been laughing

488
00:17:54,660 --> 00:17:56,260
实施整盅行为时 我也笑了
at some of the stuff that you've been doing to daddy,

489
00:17:56,260 --> 00:17:57,340
但我不该笑的
but I shouldn't have.

490
00:17:57,680 --> 00:17:58,640
我知道你很喜欢这样
I know that you love this,

491
00:17:58,680 --> 00:18:01,400
但我不希望你成为那种伤害别人的小丑
but I don't want you to be the type of clown that hurts people.

492
00:18:01,460 --> 00:18:03,260
我那么做不是为了逗你笑
I don't do that to make you laugh.

493
00:18:03,460 --> 00:18:03,860
你不是吗
You don't?

494
00:18:04,960 --> 00:18:06,100
那你为什么那么做
Well, then why do you do it?

495
00:18:07,780 --> 00:18:09,680
我很讨厌那样 我不想当小丑的
I hate it. I don't want to be a clown.

496
00:18:09,720 --> 00:18:10,660
真的好古怪
It's so weird.

497
00:18:10,840 --> 00:18:11,760
你是说真的吗
Oh, are you serious?

498
00:18:11,940 --> 00:18:13,100
那些笑话一点都不好笑
The jokes aren't funny

499
00:18:13,120 --> 00:18:14,162
每个人还在叫喊着
And everybody's all,

500
00:18:14,162 --> 00:18:16,340
"滴滴 叭叭 乌拉 乌拉"
"Honk, honk, ah-ooga, wah, wah."

501
00:18:16,340 --> 00:18:18,753
我好爱你 天啊
Oh, Lily, I love you so much. Oh, my gosh.

502
00:18:18,753 --> 00:18:20,820
那你为什么不直接告诉他啊
W-w-why didn't you just tell him?

503
00:18:20,820 --> 00:18:22,260
我不想伤害他的感情
I didn't want to hurt his feelings.

504
00:18:22,260 --> 00:18:24,260
我心想如果我是个糟糕的小丑
So I figured if I was a bad clown,

505
00:18:24,260 --> 00:18:25,420
他就会让我放弃的
he'd want me to stop.

506
00:18:25,420 --> 00:18:27,400
亲爱的 你不用担心这个的
Oh, honey, you don't have to worry about that.

507
00:18:27,540 --> 00:18:28,000
他会理解的
He'll understand.

508
00:18:28,140 --> 00:18:29,460
你不必对大爸言听计从的
You don't have to do what daddy does.

509
00:18:29,460 --> 00:18:30,800
你只需要告诉他实话就行了
You just need to tell him the truth.

510
00:18:31,180 --> 00:18:32,999
-告诉我关于什么的实话啊 -没什么
- Tell me the truth about what? - Nothing!

511
00:18:32,999 --> 00:18:35,285
不 莉莉 没关系的
No, Lily, it's -- it's okay.

512
00:18:36,640 --> 00:18:39,600
很抱歉 大爸 但我不想再当小丑了
I'm sorry, daddy, but I think I want to stop being a clown.

513
00:18:41,388 --> 00:18:44,706
为什么啊 你明明很喜欢啊
Oh, but why? Y-you loved it.

514
00:18:44,706 --> 00:18:46,591
因为...
Because...

515
00:18:47,119 --> 00:18:49,640
因为我永远无法像菲茨宝那么出色
Because I'll never be as good as Fizbo.

516
00:18:49,640 --> 00:18:52,880
他那么有趣 特别 又充满魔力
He's just so funny and special and magical.

517
00:18:52,880 --> 00:18:55,720
亲爱的 听着
Sweetie -- well, listen.

518
00:18:56,133 --> 00:18:59,093
菲茨宝确实独具一格
Fizbo is very special.

519
00:18:59,300 --> 00:19:00,680
但你也不用想着
But you shouldn't

520
00:19:00,680 --> 00:19:03,120
立马就变得像他那么出色啊
expect to be as good as he is right away.

521
00:19:03,780 --> 00:19:05,220
压力太大了
It's too much pressure.

522
00:19:06,180 --> 00:19:08,280
或许等我长大一些了再试试吧
Maybe I'll try again when I'm older.

523
00:19:09,740 --> 00:19:11,780
电光火石之间就想出那么美丽的一个谎言
Coming up with a lie like that in the moment --

524
00:19:11,780 --> 00:19:13,139
那丫头绝对不是小丑
That girl is no clown.

525
00:19:13,797 --> 00:19:15,086
她会成为一名律师的
She's gonna be a lawyer.

526
00:19:18,540 --> 00:19:19,360
好啊 邻居
Hey, neighbor.

527
00:19:21,320 --> 00:19:23,160
我只是想说 我们昨晚跟你爸一起
Just wanted to say I had a really good time

528
00:19:23,160 --> 00:19:24,320
真的玩得很开心
hanging with your dad last night.

529
00:19:24,620 --> 00:19:25,360
你不用来刺激我的
You don't need to rub it in.

530
00:19:25,420 --> 00:19:27,520
我整晚都听到你们在唱"尚蒂伊蕾丝"
I heard it all night -- you guys singing "Chantilly Lace."

531
00:19:28,240 --> 00:19:29,040
不 我说真的
No, I'm serious.

532
00:19:29,400 --> 00:19:30,320
我们长谈了一番
We had a long talk.

533
00:19:30,600 --> 00:19:32,720
你爸和他的朋友们 他们都是好人
Your dad and his buddies, they're good people.

534
00:19:33,300 --> 00:19:34,839
他们提到了军队什么什么的
They played the whole army card.

535
00:19:34,839 --> 00:19:37,952
我打算做件高尚的事
And, well, I'm gonna do the honorable thing

536
00:19:37,952 --> 00:19:39,406
把船移走
and, uh, move the boat.

537
00:19:40,780 --> 00:19:41,180
真的吗
Really?

538
00:19:41,440 --> 00:19:43,480
是啊 我兄弟说可以放在他家车道上
Yeah, my brother says I can keep it in his driveway.

539
00:19:43,600 --> 00:19:44,460
他憎恶他的邻居
He hates his neighbor.

540
00:19:44,860 --> 00:19:46,040
我觉得你爸说的对
I think your dad's right.

541
00:19:46,220 --> 00:19:48,080
我们应该对彼此好一点
We should start being better to one another.

542
00:19:48,260 --> 00:19:49,160
我举双手赞成
I couldn't agree more.

543
00:19:49,160 --> 00:19:51,260
我相信你一定会明白 一旦你熟悉我们
I think you'll see, Once you get to know us,

544
00:19:51,260 --> 00:19:52,709
我们其实也是好人
we're good people, too...

545
00:19:55,960 --> 00:19:56,800
根本没烟啊
There's no smoke.

546
00:19:56,960 --> 00:19:57,260
我知道
I know.

547
00:19:57,580 --> 00:19:58,300
好了 各位
Okay, folks.

548
00:19:59,280 --> 00:20:00,127
船是谁的
Who owns the boat?

549
00:20:00,127 --> 00:20:02,160
他...是我的
He -- uh, that would be me.

550
00:20:02,160 --> 00:20:02,900
怎么 有什么问题吗
Why? Is there a problem?

551
00:20:03,180 --> 00:20:04,300
严格说 你不能放置在这里
Technically, you can't store it here,

552
00:20:04,320 --> 00:20:05,720
某个疯婆子不断打电话报警
and some crazy lady keeps calling.

553
00:20:06,780 --> 00:20:08,880
嗨 警官 什么情况啊
Hi, officer. What's going on out here?

554
00:20:09,875 --> 00:20:11,520
等等 你们报了缉毒警
Wait, you guys narc'd on us!

555
00:20:11,520 --> 00:20:13,100
没有 我还给你拿了香蕉面包呢
No, I brought you banana bread!

556
00:20:13,100 --> 00:20:13,533
是她
It was her!

557
00:20:13,533 --> 00:20:14,840
谁是缉毒警啊
Now who's the narc?

558
00:20:14,840 --> 00:20:16,520
克莱尔 你这也太缺德了
Claire, that's pretty uncool.

559
00:20:17,080 --> 00:20:19,101
超缺德的 你们也太差劲了
Super uncool! You guys are lame!

560
00:20:19,101 --> 00:20:20,779
我还得给这些房车开罚单
I'm also gonna have to write up these rvs.

561
00:20:20,779 --> 00:20:22,380
-不是吧 -什么 不要啊
- Oh no. - What? No.

562
00:20:22,380 --> 00:20:25,020
我这儿有货 我先撤了
I'm holding. I'm making a walk for it.
